WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.968
-Welcome back
to "The Tonight Show" starring

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.200
one of the Jimmys.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.667
Boy, are my kids going
to be confused

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.601
when Jimmy Fallon picks them up
from school today.

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:08.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:10.133
Tonight is Friday, which,

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:11.634
as you know,
if you watch the show,

00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:13.934
is when Jimmy likes to catch up
on personal stuff.

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:16.300
And, since there are so many
people to thank,

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.534
I thought I might take some time
to write some thank-you notes.

00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:20.234
Is that okay with everybody?

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:22.434
[ Cheering and applause ]
Alright.

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:24.467
I've got a pen.
I've got notes.

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:27.868
James, may I have some --
Yes, oh, yes.

00:00:27.868 --> 00:00:29.501
[ Playing tender tune ]
-Wow.

00:00:29.501 --> 00:00:31.767
[ Laughter ]
-Never seen him smile.
-James is

00:00:31.767 --> 00:00:33.968
the one person happier
that I'm here.

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:36.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:37.934
-Wow!

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:39.667
-Alright.
-Dang.

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:41.801
-Here we go.

00:00:41.801 --> 00:00:43.834
Thank you, "The Tonight Show,"

00:00:43.834 --> 00:00:46.200
for letting me switch spots
with Jimmy today

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.000
and for letting me eat
all the food marked...

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:51.267
...in the office fridge.

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:52.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:55.267
Half a chicken Parm,
and it was delicious.

00:00:55.267 --> 00:00:56.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:59.434
Thank you, Jimmy Fallon,
for leaving me this copy

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:03.767
of your 2005 megahit
"Fever Pitch" on VHS.

00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:05.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:08.200
I fast-forwarded
right to the sex parts.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.701 --> 00:01:12.133
Jimmy, surprisingly,
not a hair on his bottom.

00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:15.667
[ Laughter ]
-No, no.

00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:17.400
-Thank you, New York City,

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.567
for being
The City That Never Sleeps.

00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:21.601
Though it does sometimes
take a nap

00:01:21.601 --> 00:01:23.701
after it masturbates
on the subway.

00:01:23.701 --> 00:01:26.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:26.634 --> 00:01:28.100
You get that, right, Higgins?
Yeah.

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:30.200
-Oh, I get it.

00:01:33.501 --> 00:01:35.367
-Thank you, Cracker Jacks,

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:37.734
for letting us experience
what candy

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:39.667
in the Great Depression
tasted like.

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:42.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:43.534
Though you do get a toy.

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:44.934
-You get a toy.
You get a toy.

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:48.000
-Don't trust the candy that has
to give you a toy.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:53.834
Thank you, Dr. Scholl's,
for dedicating your life to feet

00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:55.934
without being a pervert
about it.

00:01:55.934 --> 00:02:01.133
[ Laughter and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:01.133 --> 00:02:02.200
-Feet.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:06.300
-Thank you,
couples with a Sleep Number Bed,

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:09.634
for coming up with a simple way
to tell the world,

00:02:09.634 --> 00:02:12.000
"We stopped having sex
ten years ago."

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:19.567 --> 00:02:22.834
Thank you, Matt Damon,
for reminding us that,

00:02:22.834 --> 00:02:24.834
if you set your mind to it,

00:02:24.834 --> 00:02:26.634
you can win an Oscar for writing

00:02:26.634 --> 00:02:28.567
even when you can't read.

00:02:28.567 --> 00:02:30.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:30.601 --> 00:02:32.434
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:32.434 --> 00:02:33.834
That's true.

00:02:33.834 --> 00:02:35.534
It's amazing, though.
-Yeah.

00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:39.634
-And, finally,
thank you, April Fools' Day,

00:02:39.634 --> 00:02:41.534
for being the one day
of the year

00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:43.267
I can steal "The Tonight Show"

00:02:43.267 --> 00:02:45.868
without first promising it
to Conan.

00:02:45.868 --> 00:02:49.100
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.200
There you go.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:53.234
I'm done with "Thank You Notes."
You're welcome.

00:02:53.234 --> 00:02:54.868
We'll be back with Hugh Jackman.

00:02:54.868 --> 00:02:58.467
[ Cheering and applause ]
-♪ Yeah ♪

00:02:58.467 --> 00:03:01.834
Ha ha!

00:03:01.834 --> 00:03:04.801
♪ Just to let you know ♪

